// Title: User Added to Local Administrators Group
// Sigma ID: ad720b90-25ad-43ff-9b5e-5c841facc8e5
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-08-12 | Modified: 2023-03-02
// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, persistence, T1098
// Description: Detects addition of users to the local administrator group via "Net" or "Add-LocalGroupMember".
// False positives:
//   - Administrative activity
// References:
//   - https://blog.talosintelligence.com/2022/08/recent-cyber-attack.html?m=1
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_add_user_local_admin_group.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ((ProcessCommandLine contains "localgroup " and ProcessCommandLine contains " /add") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "Add-LocalGroupMember " and ProcessCommandLine contains " -Group ")) and (ProcessCommandLine contains " administrators " or ProcessCommandLine contains " administrateur")
